      "statement": "A sink target is routed through the ALSA device with id 'pulse' using the PULSE_SINK variable, or failing that the 'pipewire' device using PIPEWIRE_NODE; if neither exists the lookup fails with a DeviceNotFound message explaining that no routing device is available.",
