      "id": "claim_00e289a23bbf4f959a47f591d5c967ea",
      "statement": "SinkGuard restores the variable's previous value on drop, or removes it if it was unset, so the override does not leak into later opens while the opened stream keeps its sink because the plugin reads the variable when it connects.",
